# Headers for the public demo on Cloudflare Pages (docs/demo.md). Copied into
# web/dist-demo/ by `npm run build:demo`, and only there — the owner's build is
# served by nginx, which sets its own.
#
# The same policy the app is served with everywhere, less the network: the demo
# talks to no server, so `connect-src` is the address it came from and nothing
# else, and `img-src` drops `https:` — no link preview is ever fetched here, so a
# picture from anywhere else would be a request nobody asked for.
#
# Two directives are deliberately NOT trimmed, and they are the only ones that
# open this policy to another host: `media-src https:` and a `frame-src` naming the two
# privacy embeds (YouTube's no-cookie host and Vimeo's player). They are the
# Inspiration board's video door: a video streams from the host it lives on,
# only once a viewer is opened on it, and is never saved. The demo fetches no
# preview, so no entry here carries a video and nothing reaches those hosts;
# the two stay so the policy is the one the app is served with everywhere else
# (deploy/nginx.conf says the same about them).
# `demoHeaders.test.ts` holds the rest of it to the same directives.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; media-src 'self' blob: https:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://player.vimeo.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains

# Hashed filenames never change under the same name.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Not hashed, and changed only when a typeface is — close to never.
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

# The picture-reading engine: not hashed either, and changed only with the
# pinned package versions (web/vite.config.ts `ocrAssets`).
/ocr/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

# The shell and the service worker must be checked every time, or a new
# release sits invisible behind a cached copy.
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
